<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 245.80 mln rand S.African bonds Tue.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 245.80 mln rand S.African bonds Tue.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought a net 245.80 million rands worth of South African bonds on Tuesday after selling 52.03 million on Monday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
